{"id":"torrey:beard-the","source":"torrey","name":"Beard, The","slug":"beard-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"The Jews never appeared without — 2Sa 10:5.","refs":[["2Sam",10,5,10,5]]},{"text":"Worn even by the priests — Ps 133:2.","refs":[["Ps",133,2,133,2]]},{"text":"Laying hold of, a token of respect — 1Sa 20:9.","refs":[["1Sam",20,9,20,9]]},{"text":"Shaving of, a great offence — 2Sa 10:4,6,7.","refs":[["2Sam",10,4,10,4],["2Sam",10,6,10,6],["2Sam",10,7,10,7]]},{"text":"Plucking of, a sign of scorn — Isa 50:6.","refs":[["Isa",50,6,50,6]]},{"text":"Dribbling on, a sign of derangement — 1Sa 21:13.","refs":[["1Sam",21,13,21,13]]},{"text":"Was neglected and untrimmed. — 2Sa 19:24.","refs":[["2Sam",19,24,19,24]]},{"text":"Was clipped. — Jer 48:37.","refs":[["Jer",48,37,48,37]]},{"text":"Was shorn. — Jer 41:5.","refs":[["Jer",41,5,41,5]]},{"text":"Sometimes plucked out. — Ezr 9:3.","refs":[["Ezra",9,3,9,3]]},{"text":"Corners of, not to be marred for the dead — Le 19:27; 21:5.","refs":[["Lev",19,27,19,27],["Lev",21,5,21,5]]},{"text":"Subject to leprosy — Le 13:29,30.","refs":[["Lev",13,29,13,29],["Lev",13,30,13,30]]},{"text":"Of the healed leper to be shaved — Le 14:9.","refs":[["Lev",14,9,14,9]]},{"text":"Shaving, illustrative of severe judgments — Isa 7:20; 15:2; Eze 5:1.","refs":[["Isa",7,20,7,20],["Isa",15,2,15,2],["Ezek",5,1,5,1]]},{"text":"Created by God — Ge 1:24,25; 2:19.","refs":[["Gen",1,24,1,24],["Gen",1,25,1,25],["Gen",2,19,2,19]]},{"text":"Creation of, exhibits God’s power — Jer 27:5.","refs":[["Jer",27,5,27,5]]},{"text":"Made for the praise and glory of God — Ps 148:10.","refs":[["Ps",148,10,148,10]]},{"text":"Differ in flesh from birds and fishes — 1Co 15:39.","refs":[["1Cor",15,39,15,39]]},{"text":"Herb of the field given to, for food — Ge 1:30.","refs":[["Gen",1,30,1,30]]},{"text":"Power over, given to man — Ge 1:26,28; Ps 8:7.","refs":[["Gen",1,26,1,26],["Gen",1,28,1,28],["Ps",8,7,8,7]]},{"text":"Instinctively fear man — Ge 9:2.","refs":[["Gen",9,2,9,2]]},{"text":"Received their names from Adam — Ge 2:19,20.","refs":[["Gen",2,19,2,19],["Gen",2,20,2,20]]},{"text":"Given to man for food after the flood — Ge 9:3.","refs":[["Gen",9,3,9,3]]},{"text":"Not to be eaten alive or with blood — Ge 9:4; De 12:16,23.","refs":[["Gen",9,4,9,4],["Deut",12,16,12,16],["Deut",12,23,12,23]]},{"text":"That died naturally or were torn, not to be eaten — Ex 22:31; Le 17:15; 22:8.","refs":[["Exod",22,31,22,31],["Lev",17,15,17,15],["Lev",22,8,22,8]]},{"text":"Supply clothing to man — Ge 3:21; Job 31:20.","refs":[["Gen",3,21,3,21],["Job",31,20,31,20]]},{"text":"The property of God — Ps 50:10.","refs":[["Ps",50,10,50,10]]},{"text":"Subjects of God’s care — Ps 36:6; 104:10,11.","refs":[["Ps",36,6,36,6],["Ps",104,10,104,10],["Ps",104,11,104,11]]},{"text":"Devoid of speech. — 2Pe 2:16.","refs":[["2Pet",2,16,2,16]]},{"text":"Devoid of understanding. — Ps 32:9; 73:22.","refs":[["Ps",32,9,32,9],["Ps",73,22,73,22]]},{"text":"Devoid of immortality. — Ps 49:12-15.","refs":[["Ps",49,12,49,15]]},{"text":"Possessed of instinct. — Isa 1:3.","refs":[["Isa",1,3,1,3]]},{"text":"Being four-footed. — Ac 10:12.","refs":[["Acts",10,12,10,12]]},{"text":"By nature wild, &c. — Ps 50:11; Mr 1:13.","refs":[["Ps",50,11,50,11],["Mark",1,13,1,13]]},{"text":"Capable of being tamed. — Jas 3:7.","refs":[["Jas",3,7,3,7]]},{"text":"Many kinds of, noisome and destructive — Le 26:6; Eze 5:17.","refs":[["Lev",26,6,26,6],["Ezek",5,17,5,17]]},{"text":"Many kinds of, domestic — Ge 36:6; 45:17.","refs":[["Gen",36,6,36,6],["Gen",45,17,45,17]]},{"text":"Lessons of wisdom to be learned from — Job 12:7.","refs":[["Job",12,7,12,7]]},{"text":"Deserts. — Isa 13:21.","refs":[["Isa",13,21,13,21]]},{"text":"Fields. — De 7:22; Joe 2:22.","refs":[["Deut",7,22,7,22],["Joel",2,22,2,22]]},{"text":"Mountains. — Song 4:8.","refs":[["Song",4,8,4,8]]},{"text":"Forests. — Isa 56:9; Mic 5:8.","refs":[["Isa",56,9,56,9],["Mic",5,8,5,8]]},{"text":"Dens and caves. — Job 37:8; 38:40.","refs":[["Job",37,8,37,8],["Job",38,40,38,40]]},{"text":"Under spreading trees. — Da 4:12.","refs":[["Dan",4,12,4,12]]},{"text":"Deserted cities. — Isa 13:21,22; Zep 2:15.","refs":[["Isa",13,21,13,21],["Isa",13,22,13,22],["Zeph",2,15,2,15]]},{"text":"Liable to diseases — Ex 9:3.","refs":[["Exod",9,3,9,3]]},{"text":"Frequently suffered on account of the sins of men — Joe 1:18,20; Hag 1:11.","refs":[["Joel",1,18,1,18],["Joel",1,20,1,20],["Hag",1,11,1,11]]},{"text":"Often cut off for the sins of men — Ge 6:7; 7:23; Ex 11:5; Ho 4:3.","refs":[["Gen",6,7,6,7],["Gen",7,23,7,23],["Exod",11,5,11,5],["Hos",4,3,4,3]]},{"text":"Early distinguished into clean and unclean — Ge 7:2.","refs":[["Gen",7,2,7,2]]},{"text":"Ox. — Ex 21:28; De 14:4.","refs":[["Exod",21,28,21,28],["Deut",14,4,14,4]]},{"text":"Wild ox. — De 14:5.","refs":[["Deut",14,5,14,5]]},{"text":"Sheep. — De 7:13; 14:4.","refs":[["Deut",7,13,7,13],["Deut",14,4,14,4]]},{"text":"Goat. — De 14:4.","refs":[["Deut",14,4,14,4]]},{"text":"Hart. — De 14:5; Job 39:1.","refs":[["Deut",14,5,14,5],["Job",39,1,39,1]]},{"text":"Roebuck. — De 14:5; 2Sa 2:18.","refs":[["Deut",14,5,14,5],["2Sam",2,18,2,18]]},{"text":"Wild goat. — De 14:5.","refs":[["Deut",14,5,14,5]]},{"text":"Fallow deer. — De 14:5.","refs":[["Deut",14,5,14,5]]},{"text":"Chamois. — De 14:5.","refs":[["Deut",14,5,14,5]]},{"text":"Pygarg. — De 14:5.","refs":[["Deut",14,5,14,5]]},{"text":"How distinguished. — Le 11:3; De 14:6.","refs":[["Lev",11,3,11,3],["Deut",14,6,14,6]]},{"text":"Used for food. — Le 11:2; De 12:15.","refs":[["Lev",11,2,11,2],["Deut",12,15,12,15]]},{"text":"Used for sacrifice. — Ge 8:20.","refs":[["Gen",8,20,8,20]]},{"text":"First born of, not redeemed. — Nu 18:17.","refs":[["Num",18,17,18,17]]},{"text":"Camel. — Ge 24:64; Le 11:4.","refs":[["Gen",24,64,24,64],["Lev",11,4,11,4]]},{"text":"Dromedary. — 1Ki 4:28; Es 8:10.","refs":[["1Kgs",4,28,4,28],["Esth",8,10,8,10]]},{"text":"Horse. — Job 39:19-25.","refs":[["Job",39,19,39,25]]},{"text":"Ass. — Ge 22:3; Mt 21:2.","refs":[["Gen",22,3,22,3],["Matt",21,2,21,2]]},{"text":"Wild Ass. — Job 6:5; 39:5-8.","refs":[["Job",6,5,6,5],["Job",39,5,39,8]]},{"text":"Mule. — 2Sa 13:29; 1Ki 10:25.","refs":[["2Sam",13,29,13,29],["1Kgs",10,25,10,25]]},{"text":"Lion. — Jdj 14:5,6.","refs":[["Judg",14,5,14,5],["Judg",14,6,14,6]]},{"text":"Leopard. — Song 4:8.","refs":[["Song",4,8,4,8]]},{"text":"Bear. — 2Sa 17:8.","refs":[["2Sam",17,8,17,8]]},{"text":"Wolf. — Ge 49:27; Joh 10:12.","refs":[["Gen",49,27,49,27],["John",10,12,10,12]]},{"text":"Unicorn. — Nu 23:22.","refs":[["Num",23,22,23,22]]},{"text":"Behemoth. — Job 40:15.","refs":[["Job",40,15,40,15]]},{"text":"Ape. — 1Ki 10:22.","refs":[["1Kgs",10,22,10,22]]},{"text":"Fox. — Ps 63:10; Song 2:5.","refs":[["Ps",63,10,63,10],["Song",2,5,2,5]]},{"text":"Dog. — Ex 22:31; Lu 16:2.","refs":[["Exod",22,31,22,31],["Luke",16,2,16,2]]},{"text":"Swine. — Le 11:7; Isa 66:17.","refs":[["Lev",11,7,11,7],["Isa",66,17,66,17]]},{"text":"Hare. — Le 11:6; De 14:7.","refs":[["Lev",11,6,11,6],["Deut",14,7,14,7]]},{"text":"Coney. — Le 11:5; Ps 104:18.","refs":[["Lev",11,5,11,5],["Ps",104,18,104,18]]},{"text":"Mouse. — Le 11:29; Isa 66:17.","refs":[["Lev",11,29,11,29],["Isa",66,17,66,17]]},{"text":"Mole. — Le 11:30; Isa 2:20.","refs":[["Lev",11,30,11,30],["Isa",2,20,2,20]]},{"text":"Weasel. — Le 11:29.","refs":[["Lev",11,29,11,29]]},{"text":"Ferret. — Le 11:30.","refs":[["Lev",11,30,11,30]]},{"text":"Badger. — Ex 25:5; Eze 16:10.","refs":[["Exod",25,5,25,5],["Ezek",16,10,16,10]]},{"text":"How distinguished. — Le 11:26.","refs":[["Lev",11,26,11,26]]},{"text":"Not eaten. — Le 11:4-8; De 1:7,8.","refs":[["Lev",11,4,11,8],["Deut",1,7,1,7],["Deut",1,8,1,8]]},{"text":"Not offered in sacrifice. — Le 27:11.","refs":[["Lev",27,11,27,11]]},{"text":"First born of, redeemed. — Nu 18:15.","refs":[["Num",18,15,18,15]]},{"text":"Caused uncleanness when dead. — Le 5:2.","refs":[["Lev",5,2,5,2]]},{"text":"To enjoy the sabbath. — Ex 20:10; De 5:14.","refs":[["Exod",20,10,20,10],["Deut",5,14,5,14]]},{"text":"To be taken care of. — Le 25:7; De 25:4.","refs":[["Lev",25,7,25,7],["Deut",25,4,25,4]]},{"text":"Not to be cruelly used. — Nu 22:27-32; Pr 12:10.","refs":[["Num",22,27,22,32],["Prov",12,10,12,10]]},{"text":"No likeness of, to be worshipped — De 4:17.","refs":[["Deut",4,17,4,17]]},{"text":"Representations of, worshipped by the heathen — Ro 1:23.","refs":[["Rom",1,23,1,23]]},{"text":"History of, written by Solomon — 1Ki 4:33.","refs":[["1Kgs",4,33,4,33]]},{"text":"Often used as instruments of punishment — Le 26:22; De 32:24; Jer 15:3; Eze 5:17.","refs":[["Lev",26,22,26,22],["Deut",32,24,32,24],["Jer",15,3,15,3],["Ezek",5,17,5,17]]},{"text":"Man by nature no better than — Ec 3:18,19.","refs":[["Eccl",3,18,3,18],["Eccl",3,19,3,19]]},{"text":"The wicked. — Ps 49:20; Tit 1:12.","refs":[["Ps",49,20,49,20],["Titus",1,12,1,12]]},{"text":"Ungodly professors. — 2Pe 2:12; Jude 1:10.","refs":[["2Pet",2,12,2,12],["Jude",1,10,1,10]]},{"text":"Persecutors. — 1Co 15:32; 2Ti 4:17.","refs":[["1Cor",15,32,15,32],["2Tim",4,17,4,17]]},{"text":"Kingdoms. — Da 7:11,17; 8:4.","refs":[["Dan",7,11,7,11],["Dan",7,17,7,17],["Dan",8,4,8,4]]},{"text":"People of different nations. — Da 4:12,21,22.","refs":[["Dan",4,12,4,12],["Dan",4,21,4,21],["Dan",4,22,4,22]]},{"text":"Antichrist. — Re 13:2; 20:4.","refs":[["Rev",13,2,13,2],["Rev",20,4,20,4]]}],"refCount":175}
